   "message": "The h1 is a bare name (\"关于\") and nothing else on the first screen says what this is.",
   "fix": "Keep the name if it leads, and give the line under it (18px or more) the plain words: what it is, for whom, where or when. In the study of 97 Sites of the Day, first screens that named nothing lost usability and content points.",
